@startuml redis_worker_collaboration_sequence
title Redis 和 v2-dji-worker 怎么配合
autonumber

actor "Frontend" as Frontend
participant "web WebSocket\nDjiMqttConsumer" as WS
queue "Redis Channels\n组: v2.dji.mqtt" as Channels
database "Redis 心跳 key\nv2:dji:mqtt:health:<connection_id>" as Heartbeat
participant "web 健康 API\n/mqtt-health" as HealthApi
participant "v2-dji-worker" as Worker

== 实时消息 ==

Frontend -> WS : 连接 /ws/v2/dji/mqtt?token=...
WS -> Channels : group_add(v2.dji.mqtt)

Worker -> Worker : 收到 DJI MQTT 消息
Worker -> Channels : group_send(mqtt.message)
Channels -> WS : 推送给组内 WebSocket
WS -> WS : 按账号可见设备和 topic 过滤
WS -> Frontend : 发送实时 JSON

== worker 心跳 ==

Worker -> Heartbeat : SETEX(status, heartbeatAt, TTL)
Frontend -> HealthApi : GET /api/v2/resource/dji-connections/mqtt-health
HealthApi -> Heartbeat : GET redisState
Heartbeat --> HealthApi : 当前心跳；过期则为空
HealthApi --> Frontend : 返回健康状态 + redisState

note over Channels,Heartbeat
Redis 只负责临时协作：
1. 把 worker 消息转给 web WebSocket
2. 保存短 TTL 心跳
end note

note over Worker
业务数据仍由 worker 写 PostgreSQL。
Redis 不是业务主存储。
end note

@enduml
